# graphify knowledge graph — derived from the source tree by `graphify update .`,
# 4 MB of it, and regenerated rather than restored. The skill that produces it is
# committed under .claude/skills/graphify/; its output is not.
graphify-out/

# Database dumps and migration backups. These carry password hashes, customer
# contact details and live credentials, so they must never enter git history —
# the real backup bundle lives OUTSIDE this repository (see
# docs/NEW-LAPTOP-SETUP.md). These patterns are a guard in case one is ever
# copied in by hand.
*.dump
*.sql.gz
*-snapshot.json
rer-migration-backup*/

# Local staging for scripts/prepare-banner.mjs; banners are uploaded to Media.
banner-exports/
